sequenceDiagram
    participant Producer as Producer Client<br/>(Go library)
    participant Redis as Redis / Valkey<br/>6379/TCP
    participant AP as Async Processor<br/>(async-processor pod)
    participant Gate as Dispatch Gate<br/>(Redis/Prometheus/local)
    participant IGW as llm-d-router /<br/>Inference Gateway
    participant OTLP as OTLP Collector<br/>4317/TCP gRPC

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Producer,Redis: Flow 1: Redis Sorted Set (Priority Queue)
        Producer->>Redis: ZADD request-queue<br/>(priority score, JSON payload)<br/>Redis protocol, Optional TLS (rediss://)
        Producer->>Redis: SET request-active:{ID}<br/>(16-byte cancel token, TTL=deadline)

        loop Worker Pool (configurable concurrency)
            AP->>Redis: ZPOPMIN request-queue<br/>Redis protocol, Optional TLS
            Redis-->>AP: Next highest-priority request

            AP->>AP: Check cancellation<br/>(request-active:{ID} vs request-cancel:{ID})

            AP->>Gate: Check dispatch budget
            Gate-->>AP: Admit / Refuse / Shed

            alt Gate admits
                AP->>AP: Apply request transforms<br/>(e.g., gcs_uri_multipart)
                AP->>IGW: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Optional mTLS<br/>x-gateway-inference-objective header
                AP->>OTLP: Export trace span<br/>gRPC, W3C TraceContext
                IGW-->>AP: Inference response (JSON)
                AP->>Redis: LPUSH result-list:{ID}<br/>(response payload)
            else Gate refuses (wait-on-refuse)
                AP->>AP: Park request in memory<br/>(retry after backoff)
            else Gate sheds
                AP->>Redis: LPUSH result-list:{ID}<br/>(shed error response)
            end
        end

        Producer->>Redis: BRPOP result-list:{ID}<br/>(blocking wait for result)
        Redis-->>Producer: Response payload
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over Producer,IGW: Flow 2: GCP Pub/Sub
        Producer->>Producer: Publish to request topic<br/>gRPC/443, TLS 1.2+, GCP ADC

        AP->>AP: Subscriber.Receive<br/>gRPC/443, TLS 1.2+, GCP ADC
        Note right of AP: Message pulled from<br/>subscription

        AP->>Gate: Check dispatch budget
        Gate-->>AP: Admit / Refuse / Shed

        alt Gate admits
            AP->>IGW: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Optional mTLS
            IGW-->>AP: Inference response
            AP->>AP: Publish to result topic<br/>gRPC/443, TLS 1.2+, GCP ADC
        end
    end
